{"seq":1,"slug":"wheel-raycast-suspension","title":"轮胎射线与悬挂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/vehicle-physics/wheels-tires/wheel-raycast-suspension","wordCount":1515,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"轮胎射线与悬挂\">轮胎射线与悬挂</h1><p>车轮不是直接焊在底盘上的——它通过一套弹簧和阻尼器与车身相连，正是这套悬挂让车在颠簸路面保持轮胎贴地，也让过弯时的载荷转移变得平滑而非瞬间冲击。在物理引擎里，模拟这套悬挂的标准手法出人意料地简单：从轮子位置向下投一条射线，用射线打到地面的距离推算弹簧压缩量，进而算出支撑力。本篇讲清这条射线如何替代昂贵的网格碰撞，以及弹簧阻尼器如何把&quot;离地高度&quot;变成压在轮胎上的法向载荷 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是下一篇<a href=\"tire-friction-model\">轮胎摩擦模型</a>一切抓地力的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>每个轮子是一条从悬挂顶端向下的射线。射线打到地面的点决定轮子的实际位置，悬挂顶端到该点的距离决定弹簧压缩量，压缩量经弹簧阻尼公式变成沿悬挂轴向上推车身的力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    TOP[悬挂顶端&lt;br/&gt;固定于底盘] --&gt; CAST[向下投射线&lt;br/&gt;长度=静止长+行程]&#10;    CAST --&gt; HIT{打到地面?}&#10;    HIT --&gt;|否| AIR[轮子悬空&lt;br/&gt;Fz=0 无抓地]&#10;    HIT --&gt;|是| DIST[测得距离 d]&#10;    DIST --&gt; COMP[压缩量 x=休止长-d]&#10;    COMP --&gt; SPRING[弹簧力 k·x]&#10;    VEL[压缩速度] --&gt; DAMP[阻尼力 c·ẋ]&#10;    SPRING --&gt; FZ[法向载荷 Fz]&#10;    DAMP --&gt; FZ&#10;    FZ --&gt; TIRE[喂给轮胎摩擦模型]&#10;    FZ --&gt; BODY[沿悬挂轴推底盘]\">flowchart TD\n    TOP[悬挂顶端&lt;br/&gt;固定于底盘] --&gt; CAST[向下投射线&lt;br/&gt;长度=静止长+行程]\n    CAST --&gt; HIT{打到地面?}\n    HIT --&gt;|否| AIR[轮子悬空&lt;br/&gt;Fz=0 无抓地]\n    HIT --&gt;|是| DIST[测得距离 d]\n    DIST --&gt; COMP[压缩量 x=休止长-d]\n    COMP --&gt; SPRING[弹簧力 k·x]\n    VEL[压缩速度] --&gt; DAMP[阻尼力 c·ẋ]\n    SPRING --&gt; FZ[法向载荷 Fz]\n    DAMP --&gt; FZ\n    FZ --&gt; TIRE[喂给轮胎摩擦模型]\n    FZ --&gt; BODY[沿悬挂轴推底盘]</pre><p>下表对比三种&quot;轮子贴地&quot;的实现，解释为何射线悬挂是游戏的主流选择。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单射线悬挂</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>绝大多数游戏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多射线/扫掠（sphere cast）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>越野、需贴台阶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真实轮胎网格碰撞</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低（易抖）</td>\n<td>离线/专业仿真</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"射线为何胜过网格碰撞\">射线为何胜过网格碰撞</h2><p>直觉上，轮子是个圆柱，应该用圆柱网格去和地面做碰撞检测。但实践中这条路充满陷阱：圆柱与地形的接触是连续滚动的，每帧接触点都在变，通用碰撞响应（属于<a href=\"../game-physics/collision-response/impulse-resolution\">游戏物理 / 碰撞响应</a>的范畴）很难在如此频繁、切向的接触上保持稳定，常表现为轮子卡顿、抖动、甚至穿透。</p>\n<p>射线方案绕过了这一切。它不把轮子当碰撞体，而是问一个简单问题：&quot;从轮子上方往下看，地面在多远？&quot;PhysX Vehicles 正是这么做的——每条悬挂线先射线检测，由弹簧形变算悬挂力。射线便宜（一条线 vs 一个体）、稳定（无接触流形抖动）、可控（距离直接映射成力）。代价是无法精确处理轮子卡进缝隙或爬上垂直台阶，越野游戏可升级为球体扫掠（sphere cast）缓解，但单射线已能覆盖绝大多数场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"弹簧阻尼器-把距离变成力\">弹簧阻尼器：把距离变成力</h2><p>拿到射线距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 后，悬挂力由经典的弹簧阻尼（spring-damper）模型给出。设悬挂的休止长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当前压缩量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x = L_0 - d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>（被压缩时为正），压缩变化速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则沿悬挂轴向上的法向载荷为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z = k \\cdot x + c \\cdot \\dot{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是弹簧刚度（stiffness），决定车身被压下多少、回弹多硬；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是阻尼系数（damping），决定振荡多快平息。两者的搭配是手感的核心旋钮：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 太软车身松垮、过弯侧倾大；太硬则颠簸全传到车身。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 太小车会像弹簧床一样上下晃个不停；太大则悬挂&quot;发死&quot;、吸不了震。</p>\n<p>工程上常把阻尼分成压缩（bump）与回弹（rebound）两个不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，让车&quot;压下去快、弹回来慢&quot;，这是真车与高拟真游戏的常见做法。这些参数如何系统化地调出好手感，见<a href=\"../practice/vehicle-feel-tuning\">手感调校</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"防穿地与悬空处理\">防穿地与悬空处理</h2><p>两个边界情况必须显式处理。其一是<strong>高速穿地</strong>：车以高速冲过坑洼时，若一帧位移超过射线长度，轮子可能&quot;漏掉&quot;地面导致瞬间下陷。缓解办法是把射线起点抬高、长度取&quot;休止长 + 最大行程&quot;留余量，或对高速车辆做连续检测——这与<a href=\"../game-physics/collision-detection/continuous-detection\">游戏物理 / 连续碰撞检测</a>同源。</p>\n<p>其二是<strong>悬空（airborne）</strong>：射线打不到地面时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，该轮既无悬挂力也无抓地力，车辆进入自由落体 + 空气阻力的纯刚体运动。此时玩家的油门转向不再有牵引效果（因为没有法向载荷，<a href=\"tire-friction-model\">轮胎摩擦模型</a>输出为零），但许多街机游戏会人为保留少量&quot;空中控制&quot;力矩让车头可调，这又是一处物理与手感的妥协。</p>\n<h2 id=\"防倾杆与四轮耦合\">防倾杆与四轮耦合</h2><p>四条悬挂若彼此独立，过弯时外侧两轮被压垮、车身侧倾会过大。真车用防倾杆（anti-roll bar）把左右两轮的悬挂连起来：一侧被压下时，杆会扭转、给另一侧一个反向力，从而抑制车身的左右侧倾，却不影响两轮同时上下的颠簸吸收。在引擎里实现它很轻量——只需读取左右轮的悬挂压缩差，按一个防倾刚度系数算出一对反向力分别加到两侧。</p>\n<p>防倾杆是调校欠转过转的隐藏旋钮：加硬前防倾杆会让前轴在过弯时更早抵达抓地极限（偏向欠转），加硬后防倾杆则让后轴更早到极限（偏向过转）。这正是赛车调校里&quot;前后防倾平衡&quot;如此关键的原因——它在不改配重的前提下，重新分配了过弯时的前后载荷转移，进而调出车的转向性格，与<a href=\"../dynamics/steering-stability\">转向与稳定性</a>的欠转过转直接挂钩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>悬挂用一条向下射线代替昂贵易抖的网格碰撞，问&quot;地面多远&quot;而非做接触解析。</li>\n<li>射线距离经弹簧阻尼公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z = kx + c\\dot{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变成法向载荷，是轮胎抓地力的唯一输入。</li>\n<li>刚度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 与阻尼 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>（可分压缩/回弹）是手感核心旋钮，决定侧倾、吸震与回弹。</li>\n<li>必须处理高速穿地（射线留余量/连续检测）与悬空（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_z=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>、无抓地）两个边界。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>下一步把载荷变成力：<a href=\"tire-friction-model\">轮胎摩擦模型</a></li>\n<li>载荷转移的来源：<a href=\"../foundations/coordinate-frames-forces\">坐标系与受力</a></li>\n<li>跨库（连续碰撞检测）：<a href=\"../game-physics/collision-detection/continuous-detection\">游戏物理 / 连续碰撞检测</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"轮胎射线与悬挂","id":"轮胎射线与悬挂"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"射线为何胜过网格碰撞","id":"射线为何胜过网格碰撞"},{"level":2,"text":"弹簧阻尼器：把距离变成力","id":"弹簧阻尼器-把距离变成力"},{"level":2,"text":"防穿地与悬空处理","id":"防穿地与悬空处理"},{"level":2,"text":"防倾杆与四轮耦合","id":"防倾杆与四轮耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"坐标系与受力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/vehicle-physics/foundations/coordinate-frames-forces"},"next":{"title":"轮胎摩擦模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/vehicle-physics/wheels-tires/tire-friction-model"}}